{"id":"u-239bdc04-2b58-46d1-8980-f86bd21205c3","src":"community","title":"Iron Silhouette","author":"Bryce  T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/BXZszY-girl-split-20-1","desc":"Program Purpose\n Iron Silhouette is a high-frequency, 4-day hybrid training program engineered for women who want to build a powerful, sculpted physique without spending every day in the gym. By merging the targeted mechanics of a Push/Pull/Legs (PPL) split with a high-energy Full Body finale, this program maximizes muscle stimulation and recovery. Every training session concludes with a focused core burning sequence to build a rock-solid, defined midsection. \n\nThe Training Methodology \nThis program utilizes a deliberate blend of strength and hypertrophy to reshape your silhouette:\n\nThe Foundation (4x8): Every workout kicks off with heavy, multi-joint compound movements performed for 4 sets of 8 reps to build raw strength, dense muscle, and metabolic demand.\n\nThe Sculpture (3x10): The session transitions into targeted accessory work performed for 3 sets of 10 reps to isolate specific muscle groups, enhance symmetry, and maximize the pump.\n\nThe Finish (Core): A daily, post-workout ab routine serves as the final burnout, ensuring core stability and definition are locked in every single day.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Muscle","Athletics","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-01T14:37:21.387Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"12:3:15","sets":[{"sec":900,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Machine)","sets":[